    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d112">

                <pb facs="0196" n="176" sameAs="frus:frus1948v01p1/pg176"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.AA/3–1548: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-03-15T21:00:00+01:00">March 15, 1948—9
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1371. Following are French Foreign Office responses to numbered questions
                    contained Deptel 791, March 12 regarding Italian application UN membership: <list>
                        <label>1.</label>
                        <item>Yes.</item>
                        <label>2.</label>
                        <item>Yes.</item>
                        <label>3.</label>
                        <item>Subject will have to be given further study since in principle French
                            state they have always believed in largest possible number admissions.
                            On Finland they are “not unfavorable”.</item>
                        <label>4–A.</label>
                        <item>Yes,4–B Yes.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
